<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνέμω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pasture,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.233
				</span></i>
			 :—more freq. in 
				Med.
			 with aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξενεμήθην,</span>
			<i>feed off</i> or <i>on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.16.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				571
			</span></i> ; <i>inhabit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.524
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπης τὴν διάνοιαν ἐκνεμομένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>go forth to feed</i>: metaph. in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄψορρον ἐκνεμῇ
			πόδα</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				369
			</span></i>(lyr., s. v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Medic., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενον ἕλκος</span>
			<i>rodent</i> ulcer, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				9.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνενεμήκασι: παραδεδώκασιν,</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνενέμηται: ἐξῆλθεν, ἐξῆκται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
